;; Synthetic, non-personal. Same logical task as career-lens-opus.edn but
;; with lower evidence-confidence — the weaker model/method grounds less,
;; so the projection drops below threshold and the grounding row FAILS.
;; This divergence (pass vs fail) is the whole point of the permutation matrix.
;; Both verdicts cite the same synthetic claim: the weaker method found
;; less backing, and the shared claim exercises the adapter's dedupe
;; (one Claim ref despite two citations).
